Code (src/) in this reproducibility package is provided for the purpose of reproducing the
LDA analysis reported in the associated manuscript ("The Anatomy of a Phantom: A
Socio-Technical Synthesis of AI Code Hallucinations"). You may use, copy, and modify the
code for research and reproducibility purposes with attribution to the manuscript.

The source PDFs of the 66 primary studies, and full-text content extracted from them
(produced locally at `extraction/fulltext/` when the pipeline is reproduced), are derived
from copyrighted third-party publications and are NOT covered by this license. They must
not be redistributed and are excluded from this repository (see `.gitignore`); obtain the
source studies independently via the DOIs in `corpus/corpus_manifest.csv`.
